    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgotten Signal: Portal</strong><br>A first-person shooter (FPS) and third-person shooter (TPS) game that blends horror, mystery, and action. Designed for 1-4 player co-op gameplay, each character in this game has unique abilities, and your goal is to use these abilities strategically to defeat the main enemy through a portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABILITY SYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-Enemy Detection</strong>: When this ability is activated, the enemy's location is revealed. You can see if an enemy is approaching or pinpoint their position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-Invisibility</strong>: This ability allows you to become invisible, making it impossible for enemies to detect you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-Healing</strong>: Using this ability, you can heal your teammates within a specific area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Stasis</strong>: This ability lets you stop enemies in their tracks, rendering them immobile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forgotten Signal: Portal</strong><br>A first-person shooter (FPS) and third-person shooter (TPS) game that blends horror, mystery, and action. Designed for 1-4 player co-op gameplay, each character in this game has unique abilities, and your goal is to use these abilities strategically to defeat the main enemy through a portal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABILITY SYSTEM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-Enemy Detection</strong>: When this ability is activated, the enemy's location is revealed. You can see if an enemy is approaching or pinpoint their position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2-Invisibility</strong>: This ability allows you to become invisible, making it impossible for enemies to detect you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3-Healing</strong>: Using this ability, you can heal your teammates within a specific area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-Stasis</strong>: This ability lets you stop enemies in their tracks, rendering them immobile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
